## 6. CRITICAL "DO NOT TOUCH" FILES

Avoid making changes to these files without complete understanding, as they can break core system operations:

1. **`src/proxy.ts`, `src/utils/supabase/middleware.ts` & `src/utils/supabase/server.ts`**
   * *Why*: These manage the session cookies, JWT exchange, and OAuth interception. `src/proxy.ts` is the active entry point in Next.js 16, replacing the deprecated `middleware.ts`. Modifying cookie properties or routing parameters will break sessions or trigger authentication loops.
2. **`src/app/api/razorpay/verify/route.ts`**
   * *Why*: Implements cryptographic HMAC verification. Altering the body layout or secret decryption keys will prevent payments from verifying, resulting in users not receiving bought credits.
3. **`src/app/api/remove-bg/route.ts` & `src/app/dashboard/upload-zone.tsx` (Access Code)**
   * *Why*: The access code `'2026'` is hardcoded on both client storage and server headers. Disabling or modifying it without synchronization will lock out the evaluator or disable processing functionality.
4. **`.env.local`**
   * *Why*: Houses critical server keys. `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` is required to perform admin credits overrides bypassing Row Level Security.

---

## 7. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES LIST

Make sure these are defined in `.env.local` for the application to function correctly:

* `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`: Supabase project domain.
* `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`: Supabase client-safe key.
* `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`: Service role secret to bypass RLS (Server-only).
* `CLIPDROP_API_KEY`: Stability AI/Clipdrop key to execute BG removal.
* `NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID`: Razorpay public sandbox token.
* `RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET`: Razorpay secret authentication key.
* `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`: Application canonical URL (for OAuth callbacks).

---

## 8. BUILD AND DEVELOPMENT TIPS

* **Next.js Compile Memory limits**: Next.js compilation may run out of memory. The package scripts are optimized to use custom Node flags:
  * `npm run dev`: `node --max-old-space-size=4096 node_modules/next/dist/bin/next dev`
  * `npm run build`: `node --max-old-space-size=4096 node_modules/next/dist/bin/next build`
